{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat solver_index.md'","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L7--8 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: click_walk_to_region\n- L11--13 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: click_walk_to_region, merge_matching_markers\n- L16--19 `def play_level_3(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_su15_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_rknmzzu`\n- L22--24 `def play_level_4(env):`; calls: click_walk_to_region, merge_preserving_mass\n- L27--29 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: click_walk_to_region, merge_preserving_mass\n- L32--35 `def play_level_6(env):`; calls: click_walk_to_region, wait_for_marker_color\n- L38--41 `def play_level_7(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_su15_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_si7pk8u`\n- L44--48 `def play_level_8(env):`; calls: merge_preserving_mass, place_matching_markers, reduce_markers_for_placement\n\n## legs.py\n- L5--25 `def wait_for_marker_color(env, target_color, idle_action=(6, 0, 10), max_steps=32):` — Let autonomous objects act until a field marker has the requested color.; calls: any, connected_components, len, range, safe_step\n- L28--80 `def click_walk_to_region(env, marker_color=15, goal_color=9, stride=6, max_clicks=32, goal_index=None, arrival_radius=None):` — Walk a field marker into a colored region with short coordinate clicks.; calls: connected_components, max, min, range, round, safe_step, sorted\n- L83--122 `def merge_matching_markers(env, colors=(10, 6, 15, 11), stride=3, max_clicks=96, target_count=1):` — Bring nearest equal field markers together to a